WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.375 --> 00:00:03.525
Unit twelve. How Diseases Spread!

2
00:00:04.478 --> 00:00:08.389
Hello, everyone! I'm Nurse Bopha, your school nurse.

3
00:00:08.439 --> 00:00:12.355
Hi, Nurse Bopha! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:12.405 --> 00:00:16.400
Today we learn about How Diseases Spread. Let's go!

5
00:00:17.073 --> 00:00:20.940
Transmission. Say it with me. Transmission!

6
00:00:24.442 --> 00:00:28.142
Droplets. Say it with me. Droplets!

7
00:00:31.641 --> 00:00:35.174
Contact. Say it with me. Contact!

8
00:00:38.677 --> 00:00:42.610
Contaminated. Say it with me. Contaminated!

9
00:00:46.107 --> 00:00:49.507
Vector. Say it with me. Vector!

10
00:00:53.008 --> 00:00:56.908
Infection. Say it with me. Infection!

11
00:01:00.407 --> 00:01:04.073
Prevention. Say it with me. Prevention!

12
00:01:07.575 --> 00:01:11.241
Hygiene. Say it with me. Hygiene!

13
00:01:14.770 --> 00:01:25.940
Diseases spread by transmission through droplets, contact, contaminated food or water, or a vector like a mosquito. Hygiene and prevention break the chain of infection.

14
00:01:25.990 --> 00:01:27.448
I can do that too!

15
00:01:29.076 --> 00:01:34.285
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:34.335 --> 00:01:35.485
Contact!

17
00:01:36.476 --> 00:01:41.832
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:41.882 --> 00:01:43.043
Prevention!

19
00:01:44.072 --> 00:01:50.303
Did you know? Breaking even one link in the chain of infection can stop a disease spreading!

20
00:01:50.353 --> 00:01:52.368
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:01:53.105 --> 00:02:00.869
Think and answer. Give one example of a disease vector.

22
00:02:00.919 --> 00:02:02.069
Great answer!

23
00:02:03.339 --> 00:02:07.993
Great job today! Stay healthy, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
